 - Typical ojou-sama, has the ohohoho laugh. Loves to show off her wealth but it often backfires on her.\nRenata - Tomboyish delinquent, enjoys testing her strength but she isn't that much stronger than Athena\nDorothy - Low energy and always sleeping somewhere. Surprisingly, the most competent cook out of Athena and her clones\nYumi - Quiet but sharp tongued science type. Often hunched over.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/voNwgpvLYJQAuVYw5\n\nOcerra - An empathetic and kind, traveling hero. A bit of a masochistic streak\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/UoqfujsDj2LFqH398\n\nNiselle - A mischievous and curious imp. Loves to mess with people but often can't handle the consequences\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/hpmEqT5P2moXuPBW8\n\nLadriendariel - A confident and domineering demon queen. Very prideful\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/okzjaKeWn81LmPUo8", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@COM3q5n/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3981972, "client_id": 951125, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a83eed5/uploads/origins/0b316e7a-c4bf-4174-afac-356db2e0a9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8a51da7e56d75fc39c854c7e12cfdd0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3a83eed5/uploads/origins/0b316e7a-c4bf-4174-afac-356db2e0a9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8a51da7e56d75fc39c854c7e12cfdd0, https://si.imgix.net/3a83eed5/uploads/origins/0b316e7a-c4bf-4174-afac-356db2e0a9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8582338dadfd0578be82e97d9db7bf88 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3a83eed5/uploads/origins/0b316e7a-c4bf-4174-afac-356db2e0a9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d6f8ad8ca85d37f2ca52861b449db63 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a83eed5/uploads/origins/0b316e7a-c4bf-4174-afac-356db2e0a9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fa90fc9592138c3c01408e0c440181b5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3a83eed5/uploads/origins/0b316e7a-c4bf-4174-afac-356db2e0a9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fa90fc9592138c3c01408e0c440181b5, https://si.imgix.net/3a83eed5/uploads/origins/0b316e7a-c4bf-4174-afac-356db2e0a9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bcb780eec0f5175ad99bcca87753bdc6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3a83eed5/uploads/origins/0b316e7a-c4bf-4174-afac-356db2e0a9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2aa9f2c05515c0edb7f080b054e2ce52 3x"}, "body": "Hello again,\nYour chibi of Tiona was very cute and I would like to request a chibi of the rest of my OCs.\nI will provide a brief description of them and you are free to portray how you like based on those descriptions. If the amount is too low, please resend with the appropriate amount.\nI look forward to your work!\n\nSylphia (190cm)\nAn easy going and wild mercanary who talks with her fists (or axe). Formerly a champion pit fighter. Really enjoys food.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/mftS8tnNgCQt2u7M8\n\nAthena (162cm)\nA very shrewd and cunning underground merchant who knows how to sweet talk people. Formerly a ninja who did reconnaissance work.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/voNwgpvLYJQAuVYw5\n\nSeo & Alisa (171cm & 29cm)\nSeo is a very friendly gyaru who is actually a princess. Loves to cook, clean and look after others. Alisa is Seo's former headmaid who is now a NEET mangaka. They both enjoy lazing around.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/5nG89M2fYF6M4wmc9\n\nHilda (167cm)\nA mad scientist type wolf girl who loves to add flames and explosions to as many things as she can. Very oblivious to what is going on around her. Her eyes are always hidden.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/AbyXjd26P1UBb3nv9\n\nMiho (185cm)\nA kitsune god of love and relationships who is ironically single. Very self concious about it. She indulges heavily in wine, coffee, video games and anime. Very rowdy when drunk.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/oGY5q8NHZAWvv1AUA\n\nSerena (200cm)\nA somewhat scary looking alraune who always has her eyes closed and a slightly unsettling smile. She's actually quite clumsy despite her scary appearance and is also short sighted, so she squints her eyes when they're open.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/pCuv9P8oWxvMjw5h6\n\nSabrina (230cm)\nA confident cow girl gunslinger that is a crackshot with her revolvers. Very shy if her hat is taken away from her.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/DFmVSrj8HnNHuPjr5", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@COM3q5n/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3981972, "client_id": 951125, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/09930474/uploads/origins/2b9a4071-bf29-459c-b3f0-a57758ad348e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24e339272ef90aa9c2e5b764a8a0fe69", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/09930474/uploads/origins/2b9a4071-bf29-459c-b3f0-a57758ad348e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24e339272ef90aa9c2e5b764a8a0fe69, https://si.imgix.net/09930474/uploads/origins/2b9a4071-bf29-459c-b3f0-a57758ad348e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8dba2c47f419459015f83cd837082040 2x, https://si.imgix.net/09930474/uploads/origins/2b9a4071-bf29-459c-b3f0-a57758ad348e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc0351a7f2b944f26cebb06876f29454 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/09930474/uploads/origins/2b9a4071-bf29-459c-b3f0-a57758ad348e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=07052e616d97dadc96f3648ae5963142", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/09930474/uploads/origins/2b9a4071-bf29-459c-b3f0-a57758ad348e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=07052e616d97dadc96f3648ae5963142, https://si.imgix.net/09930474/uploads/origins/2b9a4071-bf29-459c-b3f0-a57758ad348e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=defcc87ecfec33aa24c850fcee2736c8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/09930474/uploads/origins/2b9a4071-bf29-459c-b3f0-a57758ad348e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a2c1c27d1189f3a3142cb7e9f4ddfd05 3x"}, "body": "Hello there,\nYour chibis are so cute and expressive, so I would like to request some chibis of a bunch of my OCs.\nI will provide a brief description of them and you are free to portray how you like based on those descriptions.\nI look forward to your work!\n\nSylphia (190cm)\nAn easy going and wild mercanary who talks with her fists (or axe). Formerly a champion pit fighter. Really enjoys food.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/mftS8tnNgCQt2u7M8\n\nAthena (162cm)\nA very shrewd and cunning underground merchant who knows how to sweet talk people. Formerly a ninja who did reconnaissance work.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/voNwgpvLYJQAuVYw5\n\nTiona (240cm)\nVery tall and busty but extremely shy and timid half oni half succubus girl from the countryside. Is beloved by animals. Personality inverts when her succubus blood awakens.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/LETe7irs1cRXcwW9A\n\nSeo & Alisa (171cm & 29cm)\nSeo is a very friendly gyaru who is actually a princess. Loves to cook, clean and look after others. Alisa is Seo's former headmaid who is now a NEET mangaka. They both enjoy lazing around.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/5nG89M2fYF6M4wmc9\n\nHilda (167cm)\nA mad scientist type wolf girl who loves to add flames and explosions to as many things as she can. Very oblivious to what is going on around her. Her eyes are always hidden.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/AbyXjd26P1UBb3nv9\n\nMiho (185cm)\nA kitsune god of love and relationships who is ironically single. Very self concious about it. She indulges heavily in wine, coffee, video games and anime. Very rowdy when drunk.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/oGY5q8NHZAWvv1AUA\n\nSerena (200cm)\nA somewhat scary looking alraune who always has her eyes closed and a slightly unsettling smile. She's actually quite clumsy despite her scary appearance and is also short sighted, so she squints her eyes when they're open.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/pCuv9P8oWxvMjw5h6\n\nSabrina (230cm)\nA confident cow girl gunslinger that is a crackshot with her revolvers. Very shy if her hat is taken away from her.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/DFmVSrj8HnNHuPjr5", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@COM3q5n/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3981972, "client_id": 624810, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9dafd1aa/uploads/origins/a7e8f6bb-694a-4677-ac18-6b9f6b535340?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc858c3b6e1285b6f417d3ec93c243d6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9dafd1aa/uploads/origins/a7e8f6bb-694a-4677-ac18-6b9f6b535340?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc858c3b6e1285b6f417d3ec93c243d6, https://si.imgix.net/9dafd1aa/uploads/origins/a7e8f6bb-694a-4677-ac18-6b9f6b535340?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8123dbb69b91c42995f6cd5833a154f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9dafd1aa/uploads/origins/a7e8f6bb-694a-4677-ac18-6b9f6b535340?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f11821e1c1789eae0dad0b169d6959d5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9dafd1aa/uploads/origins/a7e8f6bb-694a-4677-ac18-6b9f6b535340?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ecbc21657e80721563af21f15227f586", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9dafd1aa/uploads/origins/a7e8f6bb-694a-4677-ac18-6b9f6b535340?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ecbc21657e80721563af21f15227f586, https://si.imgix.net/9dafd1aa/uploads/origins/a7e8f6bb-694a-4677-ac18-6b9f6b535340?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bda5da17da437bc5b5dcf8e56007ec06 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9dafd1aa/uploads/origins/a7e8f6bb-694a-4677-ac18-6b9f6b535340?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=368be6f7d4ecfdfeaa764cbfa0b7b162 3x"}, "body": "IMOCIN先生、はじめまして！\n新着イラストレーター様の欄から、アイコンにされていたSDキャラに一目惚れしリクエストさせていただきます。\n\n是非とも友人達とのTRPGキャラクター(FBI捜査官の1チームです)のSDイラストを描いてもらいたく、もし可能であれば、各キャラの透過バージョンもいただけると幸いです。\n\n【キャラ設定】\n▶HO1　\nフィンリー・ハワード\nFinley Howard\n男/31歳/177cm\n目：赤、髪：茶\nリーダー。\n深い情愛を理性で律し、仲間の日常と対象の尊厳を守るため、時には大胆すら動く勇気のある人間。　\n\n▶HO2　\nリゼット・ミラー\nLizette＝Miller　\n女/27歳/160㎝\n髪：赤茶\n内面、外面共に魅力的な女性。明るくて真面目な性格。面の皮は厚い。\nフットワークは軽い、時々型破りな行動をする。\n\n▶HO3　\nシグ サイト シェパード\nCeeg Cyght Cshepherd\n男/27歳/159cm\n目：アップルグリーンの目、髪：アッシュブラウン\nハッカー。\n素っ気なく、クールそうに見えて実は世話焼き。\n歳のわりに幼く見える。\n\n▶HO4\nオーリー・ライト\nOllie Right\n男/22歳/187㎝\n目：スカイブルー、髪：ブルネット/バターブロンド\nFBI捜査官の新人。\n人懐っこく素直な犬系新人後輩。明るく真っ直ぐ、声も大きい。超のつく美形。真顔も多いが表情豊か。\n\n▶HO5　\nバーニス・ベイカー\n女/26歳/176㎝\n\nFBI捜査官で渉外担当。\n見た目はギャルだが、警察になれるていどにはちゃんと真面目。\n\n▶HO6　\nIris･Cumulus(アイリス･キュムラス)\n女/25歳/170cm\n目：薄紫→ピンクのグラデ、髪：白(後ろ髪毛先薄紫)\nほわほわとした緩やかな雰囲気、ゆっくりマイペース。純粋で他者を信じやすい。\n表情変化が貧しくおとなしめ、無口。\n\n\n【使用用途】\n個人観賞用、自身のSNSに掲載、TRPG内で使用\n\n不備や金額が合わない場合、お手数をおかけしますが再送をお願いいたします。\nよろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pUZBDDh-Pli7rljNZaZzWu1y-Qvbn-tn?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count":